==========================================================================
  n=24 = 3x8: max resonant U = 66 (e(G)=3,e(H)=14,best t=None,Delta=0)  vs 3N=72  no
  n=24 = 4x6: max resonant U = 68 (e(G)=5,e(H)=9,best t=3,Delta=2)  vs 3N=72  no
